    "physical": "The community offers Brighter Futures, a community-based health promotion and ill-health prevention program with components including mental health, child development, parenting, healthy babies, and injury prevention. The community also offers the Chisasibi Fitness Center.",
    "mental": "The community offers Brighter Futures, which includes a mental health component with information and awareness activities on topics such as depression, family violence, and stress management, along with counselling services and wellness activities.",
    "spiritual": "The community offers Elder Council and Youth Council through its Culture, Recreation & Facility Services structure. The Brighter Futures page also includes examples of wellness activities and cultural heritage activities.",
    "emotional": "The community offers Brighter Futures with counselling services, wellness activities, parenting supports, child development activities, and mental health promotion.",
    "survivors": "Chisasibi Elders' Home\nThe Elders' Home is a 13-bed assisted living and nursing home. Home facility accommodates those who are not able to perform certain daily activities anymore, despite the support of their families and home care services.",
