        "description": "Previous information: Mental Health Programs for all ages, Counselling Services, Community Mental Wellness Worker,\n\nRevised information: The Community Wellness Team provides voluntary mental health and substance-use supports for members aged 12+, including Adult Wellness, Youth Wellness, Counselling, and NNADAP / Outreach / Aftercare. Publicly listed activities include counselling and psychotherapy, addiction support, harm reduction, psychoeducation, referrals, and group programming. These help fill gaps in counselling, substance-use support, prevention, and follow-up care",
