        "description": "Previous information: Police, Medical Van Services, Health Center, Niigaaniin, Community Wellness Workers, NNADAP, \n\nRevised information: The Community Health Team offers public health programs and supports, including immunizations, communicable-disease prevention, chronic disease screening/management, health-system navigation, referrals, healthy child development supports, environmental health, and traditional health programming. The Home and Community Care Program provides homemaking, personal support work, respite, and community-support referrals, and Medical Transportation supports access to appointments including doctors, dentists, specialists, therapy, and traditional healers.",
