        "item": "Mental Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information: The Community Wellness Team provides voluntary mental health and substance use support services to the community of Batchewana First Nation(BFN). Programs and services include Adult wellness, Youth wellness, counselling, national native alcohol and drug abuse program (NNADAP) and Outreach/Aftercare.\nPrograms & Services | Batchewana First Nation\n\nRevised information: Duplicate Record",
