        "communityKey": "batchewanafn",
        "item": "Emotional Support",
        "description": "Previous information: --The Community Wellness Team provides counselling and offers a safe space for individuals to navigate life’s challenges and enhance self-awareness and emotional resilience with a trained clinician. The service is confidential and allows for the opportunity to gain new perspectives, develop coping strategies and build a deeper understanding of self.\nhttps://batchewana.ca/programs-services/#:~:text=Student%20Mental%20Wellness%20for%20BFN,about%20our%20traditional%20Anishinaabek%20ways.\n\nRevised information: Duplicate Record",
