        "description": "Previous information: - National Residential School Survivor's Society: Located within Batchewana First Nation, this organization is dedicated to supporting individuals affected by the legacy of residential schools, offering a platform for survivors to seek assistance and share experiences to foster healing.\nhttps://batchewana.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2618_001.pdf\n\nRevised information: Duplicate Record",
