        "communityKey": "brunswickhouse",
        "item": "Youth support",
        "description": "Previous information: Youth Gathering\n\nRevised inforamtion: The community offers youth support through summer employment assistance, youth recreational activities, and funding support. The community also offers Choose Life for youth mental health prevention, Jordan’s Principle supports for children, and education-related supports including the First Nation & Inuit Youth Employment Strategy, Post Secondary Student Support Program, and Indigenous Early Learning and Child Care.",
        "date": "2026-04-20 00:00:00",
