    "physical": "The community offers Health Services including Non-Insured Health Benefits, Footcare, Weight Management, Diagnostic Lab Work, Community Health Representative services, Home and Community Care, Jordan’s Principle, Elders Program, Pharmacy Services, Over-the-Counter Medication, Early Childhood Development / Healthy Babies Healthy Children, Primary Health Care, and medical transportation.",
    "mental": "The community offers Mental Health & Addictions supports including addictions counselling, child and youth counselling, youth intensive treatment, mental health case management, and Suboxone opiate replacement therapy.",
    "spiritual": "The community offers a Traditional Healer Program through the Dan Pine Healing Lodge, including one-on-one sessions with a Traditional Healer or Traditional Mental Health Worker, traditional medicines, and aftercare and follow-up. Traditional Medicine Practitioner includes ceremonies such as Sweat Lodge, Naming, Clans, Colors, Cleansing, Wiping of the Tears for Mourning/Grief, Wedding, and Passing Over.",
    "emotional": "The community offers a Traditional Healer Program and other non-residential supports through the Dan Pine Healing Lodge, including grief and abandonment groups, community wellness sessions, traditional teachings/crafts, self-care sessions, anger solutions, and family nutrition.",
    "survivors": "The community offers support through the Dan Pine Healing Lodge, including a Traditional Healer Program, traditional medicines, and aftercare and follow-up. The community also offers an Elder’s Social Activities Program with activities such as social tea time, physical activities, quilting, arts and crafts, discussion groups, health education, nutrition, tours, and a monthly elders luncheon, as well as Home and Community Care supports",
    "youth": "The community supports youth through the Garden River First Nation Education Unit, which provides elementary, secondary, and post-secondary education supports, School Services, counsellors for elementary, high school, and post-secondary students, transitions support, co-operative education information, diploma requirement guidance, sponsorship/application supports, Scholarships/Bursaries/Awards information, and Mental Health and Wellbeing Resources.",
    "connect": "The community share cultural and community gathering spaces through its Annual Pow-wow, land-based learning, and activities involving Elders, youth, and other community members.",
