        "communityKey": "gardenriverfn",
        "item": "Physical Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information: Foot care, weight management, diagnostic lab work, community health rep, home and community care, over-the-counter medication, community health nurse, primary care (nurse practitioners, health promotor/educator, physicians, psychologists, diabetes educator, physiotherapists/assistant, and dietician.), transportation services\n\nRevised information: The community offers Health Services including Non-Insured Health Benefits, Footcare, Weight Management, Diagnostic Lab Work, Community Health Representative services, Home and Community Care, Jordan’s Principle, Elders Program, Pharmacy Services, Over-the-Counter Medication, Early Childhood Development / Healthy Babies Healthy Children, Primary Health Care, and medical transportation.",
