        "communityKey": "stregismohawktribe",
        "item": "Mental Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information: st regis proudly homes the partridge house, an addiction counselling home made for indeginous communities https://www.srmt-nsn.gov/programs/health-services/partridge-house-inpatient\n\nRevised information: Kanikonri:ihne / Good Mind Counseling provides confidential outpatient mental health services for children and adults, including screening, therapy, psychiatric evaluation, crisis intervention, medication therapy, case management, parent advocacy, traditional Mohawk services, respite, home-based mental health services, wraparound services, Head Start consultation, and school-based mental health. This fills gaps in counselling, crisis support, child/youth mental health, family conflict, trauma, grief, abuse, anxiety, depression, and school-based mental health access.",
