        "description": "Previous Information:\ntraditional health care and community support https://www.eriestclairhealthline.ca/displayservice.aspx?id=41336\n\nRevised Information:\nWulamaliswiikaan ~ Delaware Nation Health Centre lists Mental Health and Addictions services, including counselling programs and referrals to mental health professionals who may use western or traditional practices to help a person improve their mental health and overall sense of well-being. The Health Centre staff list also includes a Healing and Wellness Worker and Community Support Worker.",
        "date": "2026-05-29 00:00:00",
