        "communityKey": "mchigeengfn",
        "item": "Emotional Support Programming",
        "description": "Previous Information:\nontario works is provided to the community to assist fmailies and the community https://mchigeeng.ca/ontario-works/\n\nRevised Information:\nEmotional support is addressed through broader wellness supports such as the Wellness Centre, Peer Support & Outreach Building, supportive counselling for individuals and families, peer support/outreach, systems navigation, referrals, and wellness recovery support. This should be recorded as emotional support provided through broader wellness and peer-support services, rather than as a separate emotional-support program.",
