        "item": "Contact Information for Departments",
        "description": "Previous information:\nhttps://shawanagafirstnation.ca/contact/\n\nRevised information:\nAdministration / General Inquiries\nPhone: 705-366-2526\nFax 705-366-2740\nEmail: receptionist@shawanagafirstnation.ca\n\nReception / main routing contact\nPhone: 705-366-2526\nEmail: receptionist@shawanagafirstnation.ca",
