        "description": "Previous information:\nThe board has plenty of resources at its disposal including;\n-It manages a clinic(where patients can see physicians five days a week)\n-clinic has a lab and x-ray services\n-Onion Lake has its own pharmacy\n-It has its own on-reserve ambulance service.\nhttp://onionlakehealth.org/\n\nRevised information:\nOnion Lake Health Board manages a modern Health Centre with physicians 5 days per week, two full time physicians, registered nurses, nurse practitioners, diagnostic labs, lab and X ray, a private dental facility, pharmacy, and on reserve ambulance and EMS service.\nPrograms and services include Home Care, Dental, Transportation, EMS, Community Health, Wellness, Assisted Living, Primary Health Care, School Dental, Medical Transportation, clinic and laboratory services, community nurses, Assisted Living, group homes for babies and youth, an adult disability home, and a healing lodge.\n\nSources:\n1- https://onionlakehealth.org/\n2- https://onionlakehealth.org/programs-services/\n3- http://sreda.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fnp_onionlake.pdf\n4- https://olfs.ca/about/",
