        "item": "How can we connect survivors and youth?",
        "description": "Previous information:\n-Sharing Circles: Peguis Child and Family Services (PCFS) uses guided Sharing Circles, based on the 7 Sacred Teachings, to help families and communities understand their history and dynamics. These circles provide a safe space for intergenerational dialogue.\n\n-Community Wellness Services\nTraditional & Cultural Services - Peguis CFS\n\nRevised information:\nsurvivor honouring activities and Peguis CFS youth and family services.\n\nSources:\n1- https://www.facebook.com/SCOIncMB/posts/honouring-survivors-peguis-first-nation-dedicated-the-last-week-of-september-to-/467626572059400/\n2- https://www.peguiscfs.ca/",
