    "populationNote": "population gathered from Government of Canada as of October 2025\nregistered population - 2784\nRegistered Population - Government of Canada  \n\npopulation information from Wikipedia source as of 2018\ntotal population - 2400\nSioux Valley Dakota Nation - Wikipedia\n\nadditional information from The Sioux Valley Dakota Nation\npopulation - 2683\nStatistics – Sioux Valley Dakota Nation",
