    "strategicPlan": "The SVDN AGM agenda references SVDN Strategic Plan 2024 to 2030.\nThe 2024 to 2025 Annual Report also references the SVDN Strategic Plan 2024 to 2030.\n\nSources:\n1- https://svdngovernance.com/wp-content/uploads/SVDN-2024-2025-Annual-Report.pdf\n2- https://svdngovernance.com/events/svdn-annual-general-meeting-2025-06-03/",
