        "description": "Previous information: Esiniiwab Health Centre\nThe Esiniiwab Health Centre, located in Mishkosiminiziibiing/Big Grassy River First Nation, is the community's central hub for holistic health and wellness, offering a wide range of services from primary care coordination to cultural healing programs.  \nhttps://www.northwesthealthline.ca/displayservice.aspx?id=142169\n\nRevised information: Physical health support is provided through the community’s Esiniiwab Health Centre, with named community programs including Medical Transportation Program, Healthy Babies & Healthy Children / Early Learning Program, and Community Wellness / Long-term Care",
