        "description": "Previous information: Big Grassy First Nation is organizing meetings for information sharing and knowledge gathering where community members and survivors can share their experiences and work towards reconciliation.\nCanada supports Grassy Narrows First Nation’s initiative into undertaking research and commemoration activities around the former McIntosh Residential School site\n\nRevised information:",
