        "description": "Previous information:\nThe Jane Mattinas Health Centre is a central hub for health and wellness services within the First Nation. Key supports available to survivors.\nConstance Lake First Nation - Jane Mattinas Health Centre - Home and Community Care - Congregate Dining - lignesantenord-est.ca\n\nRevised information:\nConstance Lake First Nation supports Elders through culture, language, governance portfolios, and community wellness supports. Culture and Language page says Elders share knowledge and that CLFN works to preserve the voices of Elders through recordings and digital archives so their teachings live on. Chief and Council also identifies an Elders portfolio under Councillor Christine Stephens, along with Child Welfare and Language/Culture.",
