        "communityKey": "eabametoongforthopekabanetlake",
        "item": "How can we connect survivors and youth?",
        "description": "Previous information:\nhttps://www.northwesthealthline.ca/displayservice.aspx?id=189372\n\nRevised information:\nBroader connection can be supported through the Family Well Being Program, which includes family circles, counselling, child/youth support groups, school programs, Native-language revitalization, community feasts, and traditional land-based healing events. These activities provide possible community-based pathways for connecting youth with Elders/knowledge holders, but the listings reviewed do not clearly identify a formal IRS Survivor-youth connection program.",
