        "communityKey": "picriver",
        "item": "How are youth supported within the community?",
        "description": "Previous information:\nThe community offers elementary and high school education with support offices and programs for special needs, focusing on quality, holistic learning.\n Education - Biigtigong Nishnaabeg\n\nRevised information:\nYouth are supported through Education, Social Services, Recreation, Youth Mental Health, the Pic River Youth Centre, and the Summer Student Employment Program. Education includes Children and Family Learning Centre, Elementary School, Private High School, Secondary School Support, and Post-Secondary Support; Social Services lists youth mental health, recreation, family wellbeing, counselling, and addictions supports; Community Development lists summer student employment for students ages 15–29 to gain work experience.",
        "date": "2026-06-08 06:23:25.175000",
