        "communityKey": "pikangikum",
        "item": "Emotional support programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nPrograms & Services | Pikangikum Health Authority – Comprehensive First Nations Healthcare\n\nRevised information:\nEmotional support can be provided through Pikangikum Health Authority’s Crisis Intervention, Mental Health & Addictions, Choose Life & Land-Based Healing, Youth Hub activities and programs, Family Wellbeing, Hotel/Safe House, and continuing-care supports. These services help address crisis needs, addictions, youth wellness, family wellbeing, land-based healing, safety/support needs, and emotional wellness across age groups.",
        "date": "2026-06-08 06:54:06.591000",
