        "description": "Previous information:\nFamily Well Being Program: This program provides various services, including family circles, counselling, child/youth support groups, and traditional land-based healing events.\nSachigo Lake First Nation - Family Well Being Program \n\nEmergency Response: The community has a local Emergency First Response Team and has participated in an initiative to provide mental health first aid and emergency medical support training to community members.\nhttps://www.facebook.com/IDHCHealth/posts/to-strengthen-local-healthcare-sachigo-lake-fn-launched-its-own-emergency-first-/1323087136500230/#:~:text=To%20strengthen%20local%20healthcare%2C%20Sachigo,8h%F3%B0%9E%8B%F3%B1%9F%A0\n\nRevised information:\nBroader Elder and wellness support can be provided through the Health Centre, Family Well Being Program, NNADAP, Crisis Intervention, and community cultural/spiritual supports, including home visits for elderly members, counselling, sharing circles, family circles, referrals, community feasts, cultural/spiritual gatherings, and traditional land-based healing events",
