        "item": "Emotional support programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nFort Severn First Nation - Nursing Station - northwesthealthline.ca\n\nRevised information:\nEmotional support can be provided through the Family Well Being Program, Health Programs/Nursing Station, NNADAP, Detox Program, Suboxone Program, and Youth Centre. Supports include counselling, family circles, child/youth support groups, referrals, school programs, health counselling, advocacy, substance-use prevention/intervention, community feasts, Native-language revitalization, and traditional land-based healing events.",
