        "communityKey": "maamwesying",
        "item": "Physical Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nMental Wellness (addictions, psychotherapy, \n\nRevised information:\nMaamwesying provides physical health support through Primary Health Care, Health and Wellness, Diabetes Education/Prevention, Home and Community Support Services, Assisted Living for High Risk Seniors, Arthritis Management, Rehabilitation Services, Hospital Discharge Services, Occupational Therapy, Physiotherapy, and FASD Sabkeshiinh Ngwaagan. Its Primary Care team provides regular ongoing health care, including health promotion, disease prevention, health maintenance, chronic illness monitoring, urgent episodic care, and referrals to specialists, with services such as preventative care, chronic disease management, ordering tests/managing results, advanced assessments, medication review/reconciliation/prescription, consultation/referral, pre/post natal care, smoking cessation, immunizations, and Children’s Oral Health Initiative dental hygienist services for ages 0–7. These supports help fill gaps in primary care, prevention, chronic disease care, testing and follow-up, medication support, referrals, maternal health, immunizations, oral health, smoking cessation, diabetes prevention, home/community care, rehabilitation, discharge planning, and therapy services.",
        "date": "2026-06-09 10:13:56.558000",
