        "description": "Previous information:\nBaby Lucious Neo-Natal Hub:\nProvides pre/post-natal care for high-risk mothers and infants (0-18 months) to ensure physical health and safety.\nhttps://www.nog.ca/services/neonatal-services\n\n\n\nIn-Home Support Program:\nIntensive physical support in the home (cleaning, routines, safety) to prevent child removal.\nhttps://211ontario.ca/service/65298814/nogdawindamin-family-and-community-services-in-home-support-program/ \n\n\nFamily Well-Being:\nFocuses on physical safety planning and harm reduction for families.\nhttps://www.northeasthealthline.ca/displayService.aspx?id=207368\n\nRevised information:\nNeonatal/pregnancy supports (support, referrals and resources for those pregnant/expecting or with a child); In-Home Support Program (intensive in-home help - cleaning, routines, safety - to prevent child removal); Family Well-Being (physical safety planning, harm reduction, supplies and intervention); Child Protection (child-safety response, 24/7 emergency).\nLink:\nhttps://www.nog.ca/services/family-well-being",
