        "description": "Previous information:\nObjectives & Mandate | Weechi-it-te-win Family Services \nAccountability | Weechi-it-te-win Family Services\n\nRevised information:\nWeechi-it-te-win services: Healing, Clinical & Support Services (Family Healing Program, Clinical Team, Developmental Support, Capacity Building) - https://www.weechi.ca/healing-clinical-and-support-services; Become a Caregiver - https://www.weechi.ca/become-a-caregiver; Youth in Transition - https://www.weechi.ca/youth-in-transition-program; Objectives & Mandate / Accountability - https://www.weechi.ca/about; Community Care Program; Telemental Health.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/about",
        "date": "2026-06-08 09:00:03.328000",
