        "communityKey": "ontarioaboringinalhousing",
        "item": "Physical Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nOntario Renovates & Repair Programs:\nOntario Priorities Housing Initiative (OPHI) Ontario Renovates Home Repair Program is a forgivable loan program that will assist low to moderate income off-reserve Indigenous households to repair their primary and sole residence to bring them to acceptable standards while improving the energy efficiency of the unit.                                                                                                                                                                                         Link:https://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/programs/ophi-ontario-renovates-home-repair-program                                                                                                                                                                                                      Ontario Priorities Housing Initiative (OPHI) Homeownership Program: component aims to assist low to moderate income off-reserve Indigenous renter OR First Time Homebuyer households to purchase affordable homes by providing down payment and closing cost assistance in the form of a forgivable loan.\nFunding is provided as a down payment and closing cost assistance loan for eligible purchasers. Assistance is forgiven in full after 20 years (see our FAQ document for terms of forgiveness).      Link:https://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/programs/ophi-homeownership-program\n\nRevised information:\nHousing as a foundation for physical health. Programs: Rental Housing (rent-geared-to-income, affordable, market - 3,000+ units); OPHI Ontario Renovates Home Repair Program (forgivable loans for repairs/energy efficiency); rent supplements; new construction development (in 2024-2025 completed a 30-unit supportive build in Kenora and a 32-unit affordable development in Sault Ste. Marie); Ontario Priorities Housing Initiative (OPHI) 2025-26. $35.3M+ administered in 2024-2025 across the housing continuum.\nLink:\nhttps://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/programs",
        "date": "2026-06-08 08:34:31.070000",
        "note": "",
        "links": [
          "https://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/programs/ophi-ontario-renovates-home-repair-program"
        ]
