        "description": "Previous information:\nOAHS Strategic Plan 2024-2034 (current; runs to 2034). Four priorities: Growth and Care of Housing Assets (goal of 10,000 new units by 2034); Indigenous-led housing-policy advocacy; economic empowerment; operational excellence and environmental stewardship.\nLink:\nhttps://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/about/strategic-plan\n\nRevised information:\nSTRATEGIC PLAN\n\nSTRATEGIC PLAN 2024-2034 (Board-approved PDF)\nPublished OAHS strategic plan covering 2024 to 2034.\nLink:\nhttps://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/OAHS-Strategic-Plan-2024-2034-Approved.pdf",
