        "item": "Financial Statements",
        "description": "Previous information:\nFinancial information is reported within OAHS Annual Reports. The current 2024-2025 Annual Report (released Dec 2025) reports $35.3M+ administered across the housing continuum; the prior 2023-2024 Annual Report is also available.\nLink:\nhttps://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/uncategorized/oahs-2024-2025-annual-report\n\nRevised information:\nANNUAL REPORT (includes financials)\nOAHS reports financial information within its Annual Reports.\nLink:\nhttps://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/OAHS_Annual-Report-2024-2025_PRINT.pdf",
