        "community": "North Shore Tribal Council/Maamweysing North Shore Community Health Services",
        "communityKey": "northshoretribalcouncilmaamweysingnorthshorecommunityhealthservices",
        "item": "Mental Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nMain Administration:\n\nPhone: 1-877-633-7558 (Toll Free)\n\nLocal: 705-844-2340\n\n\nAddress: 473 Hwy 17 W, Cutler, ON P0P 1B0\n https://mamaweswen.com/contact-listings/\n\n\n\nGeneral Inquiries:\ncontact@mamaweswen.com\n\n\n\nHours:\n\nMon-Fri: 8:30 am – 4:30 pm\n\n\n https://mamaweswen.com/\n\nRevised information:\nMental-health and addiction support is delivered via affiliates: Benbowopka Treatment Centre (Blind River, 705-356-1681) and Maamwesying's Minobimaadizing/Mental Wellness services; Niigaaniin Social Services includes addictions services.\nLink:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/niigaaniin-social-services/",
