        "description": "Previous information:\nNSHN Audited Financial Statements published (fiscal years ending March 31, 2025 and 2024). As a public hospital, audited statements are filed annually.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nshn.care/financial-statements\n\nRevised information:\nNSHN is a charitable organization incorporated under the Corporations Act (Ontario); audited statements published. The latest statement from 2025 is available at https://www.nshn.care/_files/ugd/329c84_816df3d75e7c410b980d6cfd2c823347.pdf\nAll other statements can be found at Link:\nhttps://www.nshn.care/financial-statements",
