        "description": "Previous information:\nCorporate Office: 525 Causley Street, Blind River ON P0R 1B0; Office (705) 356-2265; Toll-free 1-888-425-0321; Fax (705) 356-1220; Email webinfo@nshn.care.\nPresident & CEO: Tim Vine (tvine@nshn.care). VP Clinical Services & Chief Nursing Officer: Jaimee Elmore. Board includes Peyton Pitawanakwat (Michi Saagiig/Anishinaabe kwe, Mississauga First Nation). Skills-based volunteer Board with Indigenous and Francophone representation.\nSites: Blind River 525 Causley St; Thessalon Hospital 135 Dawson St; Richards Landing-Matthews 1180 Richards St, St Joseph Island. Patient Relations (705) 356-2265 ext. 2523; Health Records fax (705) 356-2574.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nshn.care/senior-leadership-team\n\nRevised information:\nCORPORATE OFFICE \n​525 Causley Street\nP.O. Box 970\nBlind River, ON\nP0R 1B0\nContact:                                              1-888-425-0321                                    705-356-2265\nemail:webinfo@nshn.care\n\nLink:\nhttps://www.nshn.care/strategicplan",
