        "item": "Emotional support programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nSocial Work embedded in clinical care (mental health, addictions, intimate-partner violence); Community Support Services (Meals on Wheels wellness checks); Patient & Family Advisory Committee. Bridges patients to CMHA and Algoma Public Health.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nshn.care/about-5-1\n\nRevised information:\nCOMMUNITY SUPPORT SERVICES\nVolunteer-matched support, wellness checks, grief support.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nshn.care/css\n\nSOCIAL WORK\nLink:\nhttps://www.nshn.care/about-5-1",
        "date": "2026-06-10 12:46:55.631000",
        "note": ""
