        "item": "Physical Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nDevelopmental Support Services (DSS):\nProvides occupational therapy, speech-language pathology referrals, and behavioral intervention for children with physical/developmental needs.\n\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/developmental-support-services\n\n\n\nCommunity Care (Emergency Aid):\nProvides material assistance (food, shelter, clothing) to families to ensure physical safety and prevent child removal.\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/community-care\n\n\nJordan's Principle:\nNavigates funding for health products and services (dental, mobility aids) for First Nations children.\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/about\n\nRevised information:\nDevelopmental Support Services (occupational therapy, speech-language pathology referrals, behavioural intervention for children); Community Care (emergency material aid - food, shelter, clothing - to prevent child removal); Jordan's Principle navigation (health products and services for First Nations children).\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/healing-clinical-and-support-services",
