        "communityKey": "weechiittiwinchildandfamilyservices",
        "item": "Mental Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nFamily Healing Program:\nA 15-day residential, land-based treatment program for families struggling with trauma and addiction.\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/family-healing-program\n\n\n\nTelemental Health:\nProvides remote access to child psychiatrists and mental health specialists for children in isolated communities.\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/telemental-health-coordination\n\n\n\nClinical Services Unit:\n\nGeneral psychological assessments, counseling, and crisis debriefing for families.\n\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/programs\n\nRevised information:\nFamily Healing Program (15-day residential, land-based treatment for families with trauma and addiction); Clinical Team (psychological assessments, counselling, crisis debriefing, in-house Family Counselling Unit); Telemental Health (remote access to child psychiatrists and mental-health specialists).\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/healing-clinical-and-support-services",
