        "description": "Previous information:\nSupports 13 member Indigenous child & family well-being agencies (10 mandated + 2-3 pre-mandated), which collectively serve 119 of 133 First Nations and urban centres in Ontario (~90%). Member agencies: Anishinaabe Abinoojii Family Services; Dilico Anishinabek Family Care; Dnaagdawenmag Binnoojiiyag CFS; Kina Gbezhgomi CFS; Kunuwanimano CFS; Mnaasged CFS; Native Child and Family Services of Toronto; Niijaansinaanik CFS; Nogdawindamin Family & Community Services; Payukotayno James and Hudson Bay Family Services; Tikinagan CFS; Weechi-it-te-win Family Services; Mohawk Council of Akwesasne (pre-mandated).\nMembers page: https://ancfsao.ca/home/about-2/members/\nFind an Agency (with contact phone numbers): https://ancfsao.ca/home/find-an-indigenous-child-and-family-well-being-agency/\n[Proof of member agencies & 119/133: https://live.indigenousto.ca/listing/association-of-native-child-and-family-services-agencies-of-ontario-ancfsao/]\nLink:\nhttps://ancfsao.ca/home/about-2/members/\n\nRevised information:\nINDIGENOUS WELL-BEING AGENCIES:\nActs as the central provincial association supporting and representing thirteen (13) distinct member Indigenous Child and Family Well-Being Agencies across Ontario:\n* Anishinaabe Abinoojii Family Services\n* Dilico Anishinabek Family Care\n* Dnaagdawenmag Binnoojiiyag Child and Family Services\n* Kina Gbezhgomi Child and Family Service\n* Kunuwanimano Child and Family Services\n* Mnaasged Child and Family Services\n* Native Child and Family Services of Toronto\n* Nogdawindamin Family and Community Services\n* Payukotayno James and Hudson Bay Family Services\n* Tikinagan Child and Family Services\n* Niijaansinaanik Child and Family Services\n* Weechi-it-te-win Family Services Inc.\n* Mohawk Council of Akwesasne\n\nPROVINCIAL FOOTPRINT:\nMaintains a province-wide service network providing child welfare, family care, and community development resources across multiple diverse First Nations, regional territories, and urban centers throughout Ontario.        Link:\nhttps://ancfsao.ca/home/find-an-indigenous-child-and-family-well-being-agency/",
