        "description": "Previous information:\nYouth in Transition Program (voluntary drop-in, ages 15-24 leaving care; Fort Frances house on Victoria Ave); LifeEdge peer mentorship; Semi-Independent Living Homes; cultural and traditional healing with Elders.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/youth-in-transition-program\n\nRevised information:\nYOUTH IN TRANSITION\nListed among WFS services i.e Youth In Transition Program.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/",
