        "item": "How can we connect survivors and youth?",
        "description": "Previous information:\nCommunity Care Program (strengthening links between children and extended families); cultural and traditional healing with Elders and traditional healers (Anishinaabe customs and values); Youth in Transition group cultural activities and peer mentorship create intergenerational connection.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/about\n\nRevised information:\nCOMMUNITY CARE / FAMILY PRESERVATION\nDecentralized delivery; Family Healing Program uses a community strategy with First Nation service providers.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/family-healing-program",
