        "description": "Previous information:\nHead Office: 210 B Gran Street, Rankin Reserve, Batchewana First Nation ON P6A 0C4 (E end of Sault Ste. Marie); Phone (705) 946-3700; Toll-Free 1-800-465-0999; Fax (705) 946-3717. Mental Health intake (705) 946-3700. Satellite office in each of the 7 First Nation communities served. Emergency Child Welfare Services 24/7.\nCEO: Karen Kennedy (Anishnaabe Kwe, Garden River First Nation; eff. Oct 1, 2025; 27 years with the agency, formerly Senior Director of Services). Board President: Wendy Pakalski.\nCommunities served: Atikameksheng Anishnawbek, Batchewana, Garden River, Mississauga, Sagamok Anishnawbek, Serpent River, Thessalon First Nations.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nog.ca/who-we-are/about-nogdawindamin/our-offices\n\nRevised information:\n210 B Gran Street\n\nBatchewana First Nation, ON\n\nP6A 0C4\n\nToll Free: 1 (800) 465 0999",
