        "description": "Previous information:\nYouth Prevention Services: Mino Madzwin; Education Liaison; Housing Support; Youth in Transition program. Plus Behavioural Therapy Model Program and life-skills/stress/resources supports.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nog.ca/services/youth-prevention-services\n\nRevised information:\nYOUTH PREVENTION SERVICES\nMino Madzwin, Education Liaison and Youth in Transition programs.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nog.ca/services/youth-prevention-services",
