        "description": "Previous information:\nPrevention & Family Support:\nProvides \"In-Home Support\" where workers visit families (up to 10 hours/week) to help with basic needs and parenting skills, preventing child removal.\n\nhttps://www.kgcfs.org/preamble/\n\n\n\nJordan's Principle:\nEnsures First Nations children access necessary health products (e.g., medical equipment, dental care) without payment disputes.\n\nhttps://www.kgcfs.org/services/specialized-services/\n\n\n\nCommunity Wellness:\nOrganizes \"Healthy Family\" events like community kitchens (food security) and sports/recreational activities.\n\nhttps://www.kgcfs.org/event/\n\nRevised information:\nChild Well-Being (In-Home Support up to 10 hrs/week for basic needs and parenting skills, preventing child removal); Jordan's Principle (health products - medical equipment, dental); Community Wellness ('Healthy Family' events: community kitchens/food security, sports and recreation).\nLink:\nhttps://www.kgcfs.org/specialized-services/",
