        "item": "Spiritual support programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nHolistic Care Approach:\n\nTahe team explicitly uses a \"holistic\" model that integrates social and emotional needs with medical care.\nhttps://www.wawafamilyhealthteam.com/program/mental-health\n\n\n\nIndigenous Partnership (Gap Fill):\n\nWhile they do not have an internal \"Traditional Healer,\" they coordinate with Maamwesying and Michipicoten First Nation for patients requiring cultural/spiritual ceremony.\n\nhttps://maamwesying.ca/traditional-health/\n\n\n(Partner Link used as Wawa website does not list specific spiritual programs)\n\nRevised information:\nCultural Services and Elder Guidance via an Elders Advisory Council; Anishinabek cultural teachings embedded so interventions and healing are culturally safe and spiritually grounded.\nLink:\nhttps://www.kgcfs.org/elders-advisory-council/",
