        "communityKey": "kinagbezhgomi",
        "item": "Contact Information for Departments",
        "description": "Previous information:\nContact Kina Gbezhgomi Child and Family Services \n Main Office (Wikwemikong):\n\n\nPhone: 705-859-2100\n\n\n• Toll Free: 1-800-268-1899\n\n\n• Address: 98 Pottawatomi Ave, Wikwemikong, ON P0P 2J0\n\n\n• https://www.kgcfs.org/contact/\n\n\n\nM'Chigeeng Satellite:\n\n\n• Phone: 705-377-5404\n\n\n• Address: 72 Hwy 551, Unit 2, M'Chigeeng First Nation, ON P0P 1G0\n\n\n\nSudbury Satellite:\n\n\n• Phone: 705-370-2100\n\n\n• Address: 866 Newgate Ave, Unit 1, Greater Sudbury, ON P3A 5J9\n\n\n\nAfter Hours / Intake:\n\n\n• 1-800-268-1899 (24/7)\n\n\n• Email: info@kgcfs.org\n\nRevised information:\nMain Office: 98 Pottawatomi Avenue, Wikwemikong ON P0P 2J0; Tel (705) 370-2100; Fax (705) 859-2195; Toll-Free 1-800-268-1899; Email info@kgcfs.org. Sudbury Office: 866 Newgate Ave, Unit 1, Sudbury ON P3A 5J9; Phone (705) 560-3988.\nExecutive Director: Denise Morrow. Guided by an Elders Advisory Council. Foster/Alternative Care: 36 Tower St, Wikwemikong.\nLink:\nhttps://www.kgcfs.org/contact/",
