        "description": "Previous information:\nLOCATION\nAddress: 401 Cedar St S. Timmins, ON P4N 2H7\nCONTACT US\nTel: (705) 268-9033\nToll Free: 1-800-461-1293\nAfter Hours: 705-360-8619\nFax: (705) 268-9272\nLink:https://kunuwanimano.com/contact-us/\n\nRevised information:\nAddress: 401 Cedar Street South, Timmins ON P4N 2H7; Tel (705) 268-9033; Toll-Free 1-800-461-1293; After-Hours (705) 360-8619; Fax (705) 268-9272; Email info@kunuwanimano.com.\nExecutive Director: Kristin Murray (Chapleau Cree First Nation). Board Chair: Roger Archibald (Taykwa Tagamou Nation).\nCommunities served include Beaverhouse, Brunswick House, Chapleau Cree, Chapleau Ojibway, Constance Lake, Hornepayne, Matachewan, Mattagami, Missanabie Cree, Taykwa Tagamou, and Apitipi Anicinapek.\nLink:\nhttps://kunuwanimano.com/contact-us/",
