        "description": "Previous information:\nEleven (11) First Nation communities in Northeastern Ontario / Treaty 9: Beaverhouse; Brunswick House; Chapleau Cree; Chapleau Ojibway; Constance Lake; Hornepayne; Matachewan; Mattagami; Missanabie Cree; Taykwa Tagamou; Apitipi Anicinapek. Plus off-reserve members via Indigenous Urban Service Providers.\nLink:\nhttps://kunuwanimano.com/\n\nRevised information:\nELEVEN FIRST NATION COMMUNITIES\nPer KCFS: catchment from Hornepayne to Matachewan First Nation, eleven First Nation communities; head office on Apitipi Anicinapek Nation.\nLink:\nhttps://kunuwanimano.com/",
