        "description": "Previous information:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/our-administration/ \nMain Administration:\n\nPhone: 1-877-633-7558 (Toll Free)\n\nLocal: 705-844-2340\n\n\nAddress: 473 Hwy 17 W, Cutler, ON P0P 1B0\n https://mamaweswen.com/contact-listings/\n\n\n\nGeneral Inquiries:\ncontact@mamaweswen.com\n\n\n\nHours:\n\nMon-Fri: 8:30 am – 4:30 pm\n\n\n https://mamaweswen.com/\n\nRevised information:\nHead Office: 473 Highway 17 West, Cutler ON P0P 1B0; Toll-free 1-877-633-7558; Tel (705) 844-2340; Fax (705) 844-2563; Email contact@mamaweswen.com.\nCEO: Allan Moffatt. Management team includes Finance Comptroller, Executive Director of Health Services, ASETS Program Manager, Technical Services Manager, Education Manager, Director of Niigaaniin Services, Koognaasewin Program Manager, Robinson Huron Waawiindamaagewin Executive.\nLink:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/our-team/",
