        "communityKey": "indigenousfriendshipcenter",
        "item": "Contact Information for Departments",
        "description": "Previous information:\nhttp://www.ssmifc.com/ou\n\nRevised information:\nOFIFC Head Office: 219 Front Street East, Toronto ON M5A 1E8; Phone (416) 956-7575; Toll-free 1-800-772-9291; Fax (416) 956-7577; Email ofifc@ofifc.org.\nCo-Executive Director: Sean Longboat (slongboat@ofifc.org). Communications Manager: Andrew St. Germain - andrewstgermain@ofifc.org, (416) 956-7575. Director, Institutional Philosophy, Advancement & Research: Jade Huguenin. Program Director: Lauren Howse.\nGoverned by a volunteer Board of Directors elected every two years from four regional areas, with four seats reserved for Indigenous youth (18-24).\nLink:\nhttps://ofifc.org/contact-us/",
