        "description": "Previous information:\nGeneral Inquiries:\n\n\nToll-Free: 1-866-391-1061\nEmail: info@oahssc.ca\nHousing Applications:\nEmail: applications@oahssc.ca\nHead Office:\n\nRevised information:\nProvincial Office (Head): 500 Bay Street, Sault Ste. Marie ON P6A 1X5; Toll-free 1-866-391-1061; Tel (705) 256-1876; Email info@oahssc.ca; Housing applications applications@oahssc.ca.\nRegional property-management offices: Dryden (24 Duke St, P8N 0A3 - NW Ontario); Peterborough (721 Monaghan Rd, K9J 0J7 - SE Ontario); Hamilton (42 Mary St) & London (343 Richmond St - SW Ontario).\nBoard Chair: Cora McGuire-Cyrette. Board includes Director-Member representatives of OFIFC, the Ontario Native Women's Association (ONWA) and the Métis Nation of Ontario (MNO).\nDepartment contact directory (phone/email forms): https://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/contact\nLink:\nhttps://www.ontarioaboriginalhousing.ca/about/administration",
