    "additionalLinks": "Official website\nContact page\nOffices page\nServices page\nCommunities served page\nStrategic Plan 2022 to 2027\nAnnual General Meetings page\nAudited financial statements page\n\nSources:\n1- https://www.nog.ca/\n2- https://www.nog.ca/form/contact\n3- https://www.nog.ca/who-we-are/about-nogdawindamin/our-offices\n4- https://www.nog.ca/services\n5- https://www.nog.ca/who-we-are/communities-we-serve\n6- https://www.nog.ca/media/1224/download\n7- https://www.nog.ca/annual-general-meetings\n8- https://www.nog.ca/audited-financial-statements",
    "strategicPlan": "Niigaan Ganinaabangwaad ’27 Strategic Plan 2022 to 2027 is publicly posted. The plan identifies strategic bundles including consistent leadership, trustworthy relationships, walking together, thriving Anishnaabe way of life, and youth empowerment.\n\nSources:\n1- https://www.nog.ca/policies-and-expenses\n2- https://www.nog.ca/media/1224/download",
