        "description": "Previous information:\nCultural Services grounded in Anishnawbek culture; access to Elders, traditional knowledge keepers and ceremonies; the Seven Grandfather Teachings embedded throughout the service model.\nLink:\nhttps://www.nog.ca/services/cultural-services\n\nRevised information:\nCULTURAL SERVICES\nAs per website The Elder’s Council continues to provide a tremendous amount of knowledge that helps ensure that Nogdawindamin provides culturally appropriate services to all the children and families served. \nLink:\nhttps://www.nog.ca/services/cultural-services",
