        "item": "Contact Information for Departments",
        "description": "Previous information:\nPhone: (705) 254-5454\n\n\nFax: (705) 254-6464\n\n\nAddress: 462 McNabb St., Sault Ste Marie ON, P6B 1Z3\n\n\nLink: https://oahsa.ca/waabinong/\n\nRevised information:\nAddress: 169 Spring Street, Sault Ste. Marie ON (downtown); Phone (705) 254-5454; Fax (705) 254-6464. Governed by a Board of Directors. Free transportation provided (East and West vans, Monday to Thursday).\nLink:\nhttps://oahsa.ca/waabinong/",
