        "description": "Previous information:\nContact | Association of Native Child and Family Services Agencies of Ontario (ANCFSAO) \nfacebook link: Association of Native Child and Family Services Agencies of Ontario | Toronto ON   \n\nRevised information:\nToronto Office (Head): 3rd Floor, 500 King Street West, Toronto ON M5V 1L8; Phone (437) 836-3660. First Nation Office: P.O. Box 834, Ohsweken ON N0A 1M0; Phone (705) 745-5035.\nExecutive Director: Micheal Miller (Oji-Cree, Mattagami First Nation). Board President: John Dixon. Manager of Training, Development & Delivery: Tammy Hill.\nMember agencies (with intake lines): Anishinaabe Abinoojii Family Services 807-468-6224; Dilico Anishinabek Family Care 1-855-623-8511; Dnaagdawenmag Binnoojiiyag CFS 1-844-523-2237; Kina Gbezhgomi CFS 1-800-268-1899; Kunuwanimano CFS 1-800-461-1293; Mnaasged CFS 519-289-1117; Native Child and Family Services of Toronto 416-969-8510; Niijaansinaanik CFS 705-763-2000; Nogdawindamin 1-800-465-0999; Payukotayno James and Hudson Bay Family Services 705-336-2229; Tikinagan CFS 800-465-3624; Weechi-it-te-win Family Services 1-800-465-2911; Mohawk Council of Akwesasne (pre-mandated) 613-575-2348.\nLink:\nhttps://ancfsao.ca/home/contact/",
