        "item": "Contact Information for Departments",
        "description": "Previous information:\nMain Office (Fort Frances):\n\nPhone: 807-274-3201\n\nToll-Free: 1-800-465-2911\n\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/contact\n\n\n\nFamily Healing Centre (Devlin):\n\n\nPhone: 807-486-1618\n\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/family-healing-program\n\n\n\nTelemental Health:\n\nIntake: 807-274-3201 ext. 2411\n\n\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/telemental-health-coordination\n\nRevised information:\nMain Office (Fort Frances): 1455 Idylwild Drive, Fort Frances ON P9A 3M3; Phone (807) 274-3201; Toll-Free 1-800-465-2911. Family Healing Centre (Devlin): (807) 486-1618. Telemental Health intake: (807) 274-3201 ext. 2411.\nExecutive Director: Laurie Rose (laurie.rose@weechi.ca). Built on six core principles: family-focused, respectful, community-oriented, community-based, Native-staffed, community-directed.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/contact",
