        "item": "Column Q",
        "description": "Previous information:\nNine (9) partner First Nations in the Rainy River District (each with its own Community Care Program): Anishinaabeg of Naongashiing (Big Island); Big Grassy River; Rainy River First Nations; Naicatchewenin (North West Bay); Mitaanjigamiing (Stanjikoming); Couchiching; Nigigoonsiminigaaning (Red Gut Bay); Seine River; Aa-kwii-no-win.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/community-care\n\nRevised information:\nFIRST NATIONS & TRIBAL COUNCILS / COMMUNITIES SUPPORTED\n\nNINE PARTNER FIRST NATIONS\nPer WFS: families of any of the 9 First Nations communities in the Rainy Lake Tribal Region living on/off-reserve; each First Nation administers its own community care program.\nLink:\nhttps://www.weechi.ca/about",
