        "item": "Physical Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information:\nChronic Disease Management:\n\n\nClinics for hypertension, diabetes, and lung health to manage long-term physical conditions.\n\nhttps://www.wawafamilyhealthteam.com/programs\n\n\nNutrition Counselling:\n\nRegistered Dietitians provide 1-on-1 support for weight management, diabetes, and healthy eating.\n\nhttps://www.wawafamilyhealthteam.com/program/nutrition-counselling\n\n\n\nCancer Screening:\n\nCoordination of breast, cervical, and colorectal screening to prevent serious physical illness.\n\nhttps://www.northeasthealthline.ca/displayservice.aspx?id=103818\n\nRevised information:\nCardiovascular Health; Lung Health; Geriatric Support; Immunization Care; Child Wellness; Sexual and Reproductive Health (incl. transgender health, prenatal/postnatal); Nutrition Counselling (Registered Dietitian); Chronic Disease Management; Cancer Screening (breast/cervical/colorectal); cardiac rehab. Lab and Diagnostic Imaging on-site at LDHC.\nLink:\nhttps://www.wawafamilyhealthteam.com/programs",
