    "link": "https://mamaweswen.com/",
    "contact": "Head Office: 473 Highway 17 West, Cutler ON P0P 1B0; Toll-free 1-877-633-7558; Tel (705) 844-2340; Fax (705) 844-2563; Email contact@mamaweswen.com.\nCEO: Allan Moffatt. Management team includes Finance Comptroller, Executive Director of Health Services, ASETS Program Manager, Technical Services Manager, Education Manager, Director of Niigaaniin Services, Koognaasewin Program Manager, Robinson Huron Waawiindamaagewin Executive.\nLink:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/our-team/",
    "physical": "Physical-health services are delivered through its health affiliate Maamwesying North Shore Community Health Services (next door at 473B Hwy 17 W, Cutler; 705-844-2021). NSTC also runs Emergency Management (physical safety/disaster response for the 7 communities) and a Technical Services Unit (water, infrastructure, capacity).\nLink:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/services/",
    "mental": "Mental-health and addiction support is delivered via affiliates: Benbowopka Treatment Centre (Blind River, 705-356-1681) and Maamwesying's Minobimaadizing/Mental Wellness services; Niigaaniin Social Services includes addictions services.\nLink:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/niigaaniin-social-services/",
    "spiritual": "Cultural and spiritual programming is grounded in Anishinaabe culture and the Robinson Huron Treaty relationship; Robinson Huron Waawiindamaagewin develops treaty governance; cultural supports delivered through affiliates (Maamwesying Traditional Health, Benbowopka).\nLink:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/",
    "emotional": "Emotional support via Niigaaniin Social Services case-management model and affiliate counselling (Maamwesying, Benbowopka). Niigaaniin provides financial support, employment assistance and addictions services through a client case-management model across the 7 First Nations.\nLink:\nhttps://mamaweswen.com/niigaaniin-social-services/",
