        "communityKey": "mamwesyingnorthshorecommunityhealthyservices",
        "item": "Contact Information for Departments",
        "description": "Previous information:\n\nMain Office (Cutler):\n\nPhone: 705-844-2021\n\nContact Page:\nhttps://maamwesying.ca/contact-us/\n\n\nBaawaating Page:\nhttps://maamwesying.ca/baawaating-fht/\n\n\n\nSpecific Departments:\n\n\nPrimary Care Dept\nLink:https://maamwesying.ca/primary-health-care/\n\n\nMental Wellness Dept\nLink:https://maamwesying.ca/mental-wellness-services/\n\n\nTraditional Health Dept\nLink:\nhttps://maamwesying.ca/traditional-health/\n\nRevised information:\nHead Office: 473B Highway 17 West, Cutler ON P0P 1B0; Phone (705) 844-2021; Fax (705) 844-2844; Toll-free/central intake 1-844-864-0523; Email contact@maamwesying.ca.\nWawa Office: 3 Maple Street, Wawa P0S 1K0 (Reception 705-856-8282, Fax 705-856-0933). Sault Ste. Marie Office: 123 March Street, Suite 503, P6A 2Z5 (Reception 705-945-4677, Fax 705-945-9079).\nExecutive Director/CEO: Carol Eshkakogan - carol.eshkakogan@nmninoeyaa.ca, (705) 844-2021 ext. 309. Health Administrative Support Clerk ext. 300. Privacy contacts: Michelle Brisbois (249) 525-7092 and Carli Prisel (705) 971-6898, privacy@nmninoeyaa.ca.\nBoard: three First Nations Chief & Council members who serve as the Executive Committee for Mamaweswen, NSTC.\nLink:\nhttps://maamwesying.ca/contact-us/",
